      "content": "the last one was empty lol. can u finish that 5th one? also, these are okay, but some of them feel a bit soft. i want them to be more edgy for a roast. like, really lean into the stereotypes about how they act in public or their different attitudes toward authority/money. can u try again with more bite?",
